  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be really beneficial to have built-in messaging and video call features. This would make it much easier to connect with friends and even video call across different game instances. It would also help players remember each other better, especially since in-game messages are more accessible than sifting through old bios or Discord chats. For younger players who might not be allowed to add people on social media, this offers a safe way to stay in touch with in-game friends without sharing personal information. This also helps keep real-life and online connections separate. Additionally, having all communications within the game could make it easier to identify and address any inappropriate behavior, helping to keep everyone safer.",
